        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Gex: Enter the Gecko",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "\"Is it just me, or am I engulfed in flames?\" is one of the many one-liners uttered by Gex, a wise cracking gecko who should check himself into television rehab; he's addicted to it. After saving the Television Realm from the evil Rez in his first adventure, the gecko was ready to kick back, relax, and watch a little television. Little did he know his adventure was just beginning.\n\nOne day, two secret agent goons showed up at Gex's doorstep. They inform him that Rez is back and looking for vengeance; the evil monster is planning to destroy the Television Realm once more...and possibly the world. When Gex tells them that he's retired and doesn't care, one of the goons hits the gecko on the head and takes him to a secluded place.\n\nWhen Gex comes to, the mystery men plead with the gecko to take the cash and help destroy Rez for good...or at least make him disappear. With that incentive (the cash), the wise cracking lizard slips into his special agent suit and plunges headfirst into the Television Realm. Watch out, Rez -- Gex is back!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "“¿Seré yo, o me veo envuelto en llamas?” es una de las muchas frases ingeniosas que suelta Gex, un gecko bocazas que debería internarse en una clínica de rehabilitación para la televisión; es adicto a ella. Tras salvar al Reino de la Televisión del malvado Rez en su primera aventura, el gecko estaba listo para relajarse y ver un poco de televisión. Poco sabía que su aventura apenas comenzaba.\n\nUn día, dos matones agentes secretos llegaron a la puerta de Gex. Le informaron de que Rez ha vuelto y busca venganza: el monstruo malvado planea destruir el Reino de la Televisión una vez más... y quizá el mundo entero. Cuando Gex les dice que está retirado y no le importa, uno de los matones le golpea en la cabeza y lo lleva a un lugar apartado.\n\nCuando Gex recupera el conocimiento, los misteriosos hombres le suplican que tome el dinero y ayude a destruir a Rez para siempre, o al menos que lo haga desaparecer. Con ese incentivo (el dinero), el lagarto bocazas se pone su traje de agente especial y se lanza de cabeza al Reino de la Televisión. ¡Cuidado, Rez: Gex ha vuelto!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1998",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
